sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client / Internal App
    participant CB as Chat Bot App
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant GW as API FW GW (xN)
    participant CC as Config Cache
    participant PC as Prompt Cache
    participant M1 as Model Prompt Injection
    participant M2 as Model PII
    participant M3 as Model Jailbreak
    participant MB as Message Bus
    participant SP as Statistics Processor
    participant SDB as Statistics DB

    C->>CB: send prompt
    CB->>LB: forward request
    LB->>RL: route request
    RL->>GW: forward (rate OK)

    GW->>CC: get customer config
    CC-->>GW: config (cache hit)

    GW->>PC: lookup hash(customer+prompt)
    PC-->>GW: miss

    Note over GW: Start global request timer

    par Parallel model scanning
        GW->>M1: scan(prompt)
    and
        GW->>M2: scan(prompt)
    and
        GW->>M3: scan(prompt)
    end

    Note over GW,CB: Progress notification path
    Note over GW: Global timer threshold exceeded<br/>verdict not yet received
    GW-->>CB: "Request is taking longer than expected,<br/>please wait..."
    CB-->>C: progress notification (SSE)

    Note over GW,M1: Early termination — first BLOCK wins
    M1-->>GW: BLOCK (prompt injection detected)

    break model returned BLOCK
        GW->>M2: cancel
        GW->>M3: cancel
        GW->>PC: cache verdict BLOCK
        GW-->>CB: 403 — blocked: prompt injection
        CB-->>C: block reason shown in UI
    end

    GW-)MB: emit block event (async)
    MB-)SP: consume event
    SP-)SDB: persist block statistics

    Note over GW,SDB: Rate limit exceeded path
    RL-->>CB: 429 — rate limit exceeded
    CB-->>C: rate limit error

